---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import IllustrationFrame from '../components/IllustrationFrame.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="About · Venkatesh Patnala"
  description="Backend engineer at Cars24. The longer story — origin, current work, how I think about AI, and what I'm chasing next."
  ogType="profile"
  activePage="about"
>

  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="about-hero-wrap">
    <div class="about-hero">
      <div class="hero-text">
        <span class="kicker-line">
          <span class="kicker-bar"></span>
          ABOUT
        </span>
        <h1 class="hero-h1">Hi, I'm Venkatesh Patnala.</h1>
        <p class="hero-intro">I build backend systems and write down what I learn.</p>
        <span class="hero-sig">— v.</span>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-image-col">
        <IllustrationFrame caption="sketched by AI · somewhere along a river" />
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  {/* hidden per request — currently callout paused
  <div class="currently-wrap">
    <a href="/#currently" class="currently-callout">
      <div class="currently-left">
        <span class="currently-dot"></span>
        <div class="currently-text">
          <span class="currently-label">CURRENTLY</span>
          <span class="currently-title">Building a content automation pipeline with Claude + Firebase</span>
          <span class="currently-sub">and reading <em>Designing Data-Intensive Applications</em>, again.</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </a>
  </div>
  */}

  <!-- Section 01 · Origin -->
  <section class="about-section">
    <div class="section-inner">
      <div class="section-kicker">
        <span class="kicker-bar"></span>
        01 · ORIGIN
      </div>
      <h2 class="section-h2">How I got here.</h2>
      <div class="body-text">
        <p>I grew up in Andhra Pradesh, studying at Jawahar Navodaya Vidyalaya.</p>
        <p>At IIT Jodhpur, mechanical was the degree but I liked computer science (maybe it's easier to build). Second year we started shipping real systems. An internship at Aspiro showed me what software is. I liked the invisible work, the kind nobody notices until it breaks.</p>
        <p>Since April 2025 I've been a backend engineer at Cars24, working on high-volume data flows: listings, pricing pipelines, event-driven workflows that have to stay consistent under load.</p>
        <p>And yes — for the last 3 years I've been living in Gurugram, Haryana, swimming to office in the monsoons.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Section 02 · How I Work -->
  <section class="about-section">
    <div class="section-inner">
      <div class="section-kicker">
        <span class="kicker-bar"></span>
        02 · HOW I WORK
      </div>
      <h2 class="section-h2">AI in the loop, <em class="green-em">not at the wheel.</em></h2>
      <div class="body-text">
        <p>The "should you use AI" question bores me. The real question is <em>how much</em> I use.</p>
        <p>I reach for AI on most of my work, trying to automate the flows that need less attention — a summary of stock news at 9 AM, a summary of office work and meetings at 10 AM. I use it to find the missing edge case, to write test cases, to test flows — not only to write code.</p>
        <p>The pattern that works: AI handles the shape, I handle the architecture and intent. It writes the first version, I do the critical read. Working code isn't production-ready code, and maybe not clean code either.</p>
      </div>
      <blockquote class="pullquote">AI writes the code. I do the reading and the optimizing.</blockquote>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Section 04 · What I'm Chasing -->
  <section class="about-section">
    <div class="section-inner">
      <div class="section-kicker">
        <span class="kicker-bar"></span>
        03 · WHAT'S NEXT
      </div>
      <h2 class="section-h2">What I'm <em class="green-em">chasing</em> now.</h2>
      <div class="body-text">
        <ul class="about-list">
          <li>Get genuinely good at distributed systems — intuit CAP tradeoffs, not memorise them.</li>
          <li>Checking how much I can automate with AI.</li>
          <li>Write more, and more honestly.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Section 05 · Off Screen -->
  <section class="about-section">
    <div class="section-inner">
      <div class="section-kicker">
        <span class="kicker-bar"></span>
        04 · OFF SCREEN
      </div>
      <h2 class="section-h2">Things that aren't <em class="green-em">code.</em></h2>
      <div class="body-text">
        <p>I read a lot — mostly nonfiction. I travel when I can.</p>
        <p>What I'm reading, watching, or where I went last — it's all on <a href="/life" class="gu">/life</a>.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Section 06 · Education -->
  <section class="about-section">
    <div class="section-inner">
      <div class="section-kicker">
        <span class="kicker-bar"></span>
        05 · EDUCATION
      </div>
      <h2 class="section-h2">Where I <em class="green-em">learned.</em></h2>
      <div class="edu-timeline">
        <div class="edu-entry">
          <div class="edu-year">2019 — 2023</div>
          <div class="edu-detail">
            <div class="edu-title">B.Tech, Mechanical Engineering</div>
            <div class="edu-where">Indian Institute of Technology, Jodhpur</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="edu-entry">
          <div class="edu-year">2017 — 2019</div>
          <div class="edu-detail">
            <div class="edu-title">Higher secondary (PCM)</div>
            <div class="edu-where">Jawahar Navodaya Vidyalaya</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="cta-wrap">
    <div class="cta-card">
      <div class="cta-left">
        <span class="cta-kicker">DOWN TO TALK</span>
        <h2 class="cta-h2">If any of that <em>resonates</em>, let's chat.</h2>
        <p class="cta-p">I'm open to SDE-2 roles, side project collaborations, and good engineering conversations. Drop me a line — I read everything.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="cta-buttons">
        <a href="mailto:venkateshjnv123@gmail.com" class="btn-primary">email me →</a>
        <a href="/writing" class="btn-secondary">or read my latest writing</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</BaseLayout>

<style>
/* ─── Hero ────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
.about-hero-wrap {
  max-width: 980px;
  margin: 0 auto;
  padding: 3rem 2rem 2rem;
}

.about-hero {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr 380px;
  gap: 3rem;
  align-items: start;
}

.kicker-line {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 10px;
  font-family: var(--font-mono);
  font-size: 11px;
  color: #C4583A;
  letter-spacing: 0.12em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
}

.kicker-bar {
  display: inline-block;
  width: 20px;
  height: 1.5px;
  background: currentColor;
  flex-shrink: 0;
}

.hero-h1 {
  font-family: var(--font-serif);
  font-size: 56px;
  font-weight: 400;
  line-height: 1.05;
  letter-spacing: -0.025em;
  color: #1A1A17;
  margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
}

.hero-intro {
  font-family: var(--font-serif);
  font-style: italic;
  font-size: 18px;
  color: #4A4A45;
  line-height: 1.55;
  max-width: 440px;
  margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
}

.hero-sig {
  font-family: var(--font-serif);
  font-style: italic;
  font-size: 15px;
  color: #0F4C3A;
  letter-spacing: -0.005em;
}

.hero-image-col {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  align-items: center;
}

.about-illustration-wrap {
  position: relative;
  display: inline-block;
}

.about-illustration {
  display: block;
  border-radius: 14px;
  width: 100%;
  max-width: 380px;
  height: auto;
}

.about-illustration-wrap::before {
  content: '';
  position: absolute;
  inset: -8px;
  border: 1px dashed #0F4C3A;
  border-radius: 16px;
  opacity: 0.3;
  z-index: -1;
  transform: rotate(-0.5deg);
}

.illustration-caption {
  font-family: var(--font-serif);
  font-style: italic;
  font-size: 12px;
  color: #8A8A82;
  margin-top: 0.75rem;
  text-align: center;
}

/* ─── Currently callout ───────────────────────────────────── */
.currently-wrap {
  max-width: 720px;
  margin: 0 auto;
  padding: 0 2rem 2rem;
}

.currently-callout {
  background: #FDFCF6;
  border: 0.5px solid #D9D5C7;
  border-left: 3px solid #1F7A5E;
  border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0;
  padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: 1rem;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  transition: border-left-color 0.15s;
}

.currently-callout:hover { border-left-color: #0F4C3A; }

.currently-left {
  display: flex;
  align-items: flex-start;
  gap: 10px;
}

.currently-dot {
  width: 8px;
  height: 8px;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: #1F7A5E;
  flex-shrink: 0;
  margin-top: 4px;
  animation: pulse 2s ease-in-out infinite;
}

@keyframes pulse {
  0%, 100% { opacity: 1; transform: scale(1); }
  50% { opacity: 0.5; transform: scale(0.85); }
}

.currently-text {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 2px;
}

.currently-label {
  font-family: var(--font-mono);
  font-size: 10px;
  color: #1F7A5E;
  font-weight: 500;
  letter-spacing: 0.08em;
}

.currently-title {
  font-family: var(--font-serif);
  font-style: italic;
  font-size: 15px;
  color: #1A1A17;
}

.currently-sub {
  font-family: var(--font-serif);
  font-style: italic;
  font-size: 15px;
  color: #4A4A45;
}

.currently-link {
  font-family: var(--font-mono);
  font-size: 12px;
  color: #0F4C3A;
  font-weight: 500;
  border-bottom: 1px solid currentColor;
  white-space: nowrap;
}

.currently-callout:hover .currently-link { color: #1F7A5E; }

/* ─── Body sections ───────────────────────────────────────── */
.about-section {
  max-width: 720px;
  margin: 0 auto;
  padding: 2rem 2rem 1rem;
}

.section-inner { width: 100%; }

.section-kicker {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 10px;
  font-family: var(--font-mono);
  font-size: 11px;
  color: #0F4C3A;
  letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
}

.section-h2 {
  font-family: var(--font-serif);
  font-size: 30px;
  font-weight: 400;
  line-height: 1.15;
  letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  color: #1A1A17;
  margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
}

.green-em {
  font-style: italic;
  color: #0F4C3A;
}

.body-text p {
  font-family: var(--font-serif);
  font-size: 17px;
  color: #1A1A17;
  line-height: 1.7;
  margin-bottom: 1rem;
}

.body-text a.gu {
  color: #0F4C3A;
  border-bottom: 1px solid #0F4C3A;
  padding-bottom: 1px;
  transition: color 0.15s;
}

.body-text a.gu:hover { color: #1F7A5E; }

/* ─── Theme pills ─────────────────────────────────────────── */
.theme-pills {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 8px;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  margin-top: 1.25rem;
}

.theme-label {
  font-family: var(--font-mono);
  font-size: 11px;
  color: #8A8A82;
}

.pill {
  font-family: var(--font-mono);
  font-size: 11px;
  color: #0F4C3A;
  background: #E6EFEA;
  padding: 1px 6px;
  border-radius: 3px;
}

/* ─── Pull quote ──────────────────────────────────────────── */
.pullquote {
  font-family: var(--font-serif);
  font-style: italic;
  font-size: 22px;
  line-height: 1.4;
  color: #0F4C3A;
  border-left: 3px solid #D69E2E;
  padding: 0.5rem 0 0.5rem 1.25rem;
  margin: 1.5rem 0;
  max-width: 480px;
}

/* ─── What I'm chasing list ───────────────────────────────── */
.about-list {
  list-style: none;
  padding-left: 0;
  margin: 0.75rem 0 1rem;
}

.about-list li {
  font-family: var(--font-serif);
  font-style: italic;
  font-size: 17px;
  line-height: 1.6;
  color: #1A1A17;
  padding-left: 24px;
  position: relative;
  margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
}

.about-list li::before {
  content: '—';
  position: absolute;
  left: 0;
  color: #0F4C3A;
  font-style: normal;
  font-weight: 500;
}

/* ─── Education timeline ──────────────────────────────────── */
.edu-timeline {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 0;
  margin-top: 1rem;
}

.edu-entry {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 140px 1fr;
  gap: 1.5rem;
  align-items: start;
  padding: 0.75rem 0;
  border-bottom: 0.5px dashed #D9D5C7;
}

.edu-entry:last-child { border-bottom: none; }

.edu-year {
  font-family: var(--font-mono);
  font-size: 12px;
  color: #8A8A82;
  letter-spacing: 0.04em;
  padding-top: 2px;
}

.edu-title {
  font-size: 15px;
  font-weight: 500;
  color: #1A1A17;
  margin-bottom: 2px;
}

.edu-where {
  font-size: 13px;
  color: #4A4A45;
  font-style: italic;
  font-family: var(--font-serif);
}

/* ─── CTA ─────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
.cta-wrap {
  max-width: 980px;
  margin: 2rem auto 0;
  padding: 0 2rem 4rem;
}

.cta-card {
  background: #0F1F1A;
  border-radius: 12px;
  padding: 3.5rem 3rem;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: 3rem;
}

.cta-kicker {
  display: block;
  font-family: var(--font-mono);
  font-size: 10px;
  color: #4A8A70;
  letter-spacing: 0.16em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
}

.cta-h2 {
  font-family: var(--font-serif);
  font-size: 34px;
  font-weight: 400;
  line-height: 1.1;
  letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  color: #E8E4D9;
  margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
}

.cta-h2 em {
  font-style: italic;
  color: #D69E2E;
}

.cta-p {
  font-family: var(--font-serif);
  font-size: 15px;
  color: #7A8A80;
  line-height: 1.6;
  max-width: 400px;
}

.cta-buttons {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 0.75rem;
  flex-shrink: 0;
}

.btn-primary {
  font-family: var(--font-mono);
  font-size: 13px;
  color: #0F1F1A;
  background: #D69E2E;
  padding: 0.65rem 1.5rem;
  border-radius: 4px;
  font-weight: 500;
  text-align: center;
  white-space: nowrap;
  transition: background 0.15s;
}

.btn-primary:hover { background: #C48E20; }

.btn-secondary {
  font-family: var(--font-mono);
  font-size: 12px;
  color: #4A8A70;
  text-align: center;
  border-bottom: 1px solid #2A5A40;
  padding-bottom: 2px;
  transition: color 0.15s;
  white-space: nowrap;
}

.btn-secondary:hover { color: #6AAA90; }

/* ─── Responsive ──────────────────────────────────────────── */
@media (max-width: 800px) {
  .about-hero {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 2rem;
  }

  .hero-image-col { order: -1; }

  .about-illustration-wrap { max-width: 280px; margin: 0 auto; }

  .hero-h1 { font-size: 38px; }

  .about-section { padding: 1.5rem 1.25rem; }

  .edu-entry { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 4px; }

  .pullquote { font-size: 18px; }

  .currently-callout { flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; }

  .cta-card {
    flex-direction: column;
    padding: 2.5rem 1.5rem;
  }

  .cta-h2 { font-size: 26px; }

  .cta-buttons { width: 100%; }

  .btn-primary, .btn-secondary { width: 100%; }
}
</style>
